Z||000007||KRMFiero||07-16-2001||06:46 AM||||Just buy some exaust hanging brackets from AutoZone then go to your local ricer store and spend 225$ on a Muffler, if it is already inspected take it to your muffler shop and have them cut off infront of the Cat and then remove all the spring hangers; then when you already have your muffler mounted where you want it (make sure you can move it around a little bit) have them weld up a new pipe||||reg||1
